                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-387158d1-9900-49b4-815c-972936778da7" type="torculus" xml:id="m-3c1cb1bd-92ee-45f4-8a5b-ac269a503f8d">
                    <nc xml:id="m-2cbc93e9-0043-4e1e-a72e-2456efe4530c" pname="d" oct="3" />
                    <nc xml:id="m-b18a93ed-1fe9-400f-b658-2affe89631d5" pname="e" oct="3" />
                    <nc xml:id="m-7d098358-4487-4fab-afd3-ec7047a38768" pname="d" oct="3" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <divLine xml:id="m-0cc6be94-5128-4ff4-868c-aac6c6123a0c" facs="#m-b20cd4ef-5e4d-45f8-9977-335fcb507f64" form="finalis" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-8fa227fe-2e4b-45b0-b527-c67344579f02">
              <lg xml:id="m-61fb5b58-9371-447e-8291-192ed404e851">
                <l xml:id="m-1d4fbe55-66a6-4f1a-b134-9d0fbfc30897" facs="#m-e59c4499-72f8-4704-b4cd-f1d1742dc7b3" label="text-like">At Matins.</l><l xml:id="m-ce6e8f3a-1a88-4a56-82a0-47f301987605" facs="#m-1eada903-a074-461f-8dda-b86c3860bc75" label="ambiguous">937</l><l xml:id="m-63ddbaf5-d8c6-4d77-8d5b-6d181c2fef01" facs="#m-518f0d62-f59e-4b45-a1bf-7db11557b07c" label="lyrics-like">3. Etenim pásser invénit síbi dómum: “et túrtur nídum sibi, ubi</l><l xml:id="m-57071db5-56fe-4c7b-8295-a93ca8db920d" facs="#m-89dcaa27-9e00-4400-a4ae-28596d6bf170" label="lyrics-like">pónat púllos sùos.</l><l xml:id="m-49c6f1a9-e026-4e31-9454-6f5829e29098" facs="#m-85d407d2-0220-4540-a08f-3e17ce273bb5" label="lyrics-like">4. Altária túa, Dómine virtútum:*Rex méus, et Déus méus.</l><l xml:id="m-770863b4-727b-47e0-83c2-c6a7af66de0c" facs="#m-e3ce676c-1f71-4f6c-a4bb-77d57d6accbd" label="lyrics-like">5. Beáti qui hábitant in dómo túa, Dómine:*in saécula saeculórum</l><l xml:id="m-2b896617-7ab9-4517-a5fb-8099736a10e5" facs="#m-794db94c-492c-46b3-a0d0-c0d5c2e32252" label="lyrics-like">laudábunt te.</l><l xml:id="m-b8a30e10-0d93-42fc-868c-22d02ef699b6" facs="#m-180cd1f5-1391-49c6-b4df-f2893e66a978" label="lyrics-like">6. Beátus vir, cúius est auxílium abs te: t ascensiónes in córde súo</l><l xml:id="m-308f8372-ad17-43e4-82be-b03b8ccf0b36" facs="#m-30ff3328-9dbd-478e-adf0-e25f62937ca8" label="lyrics-like">dispósuit, in valle lacrimárum, * in loco quem pósuit.</l><l xml:id="m-49993d44-58ed-4b6d-a43f-240c56715e5f" facs="#m-cf708442-fd9e-4cc4-8406-d6f26f6ae068" label="lyrics-like">7. Etenim benedictiónem dábit legislátor, t ibunt de virtúte in vir¬</l><l xml:id="m-d3d12cfb-5804-490a-90d8-e0b210ad3c65" facs="#m-4e8a3cba-da25-4806-9bd7-3b1ee20ecfe8" label="lyrics-like">tútem:*vidébitur Déus deórum in Sion.</l><l xml:id="m-56d259e8-013b-4a1b-9c08-76661b5b96bb" facs="#m-9f2bbb3c-657c-423e-a453-df54eb200bbf" label="lyrics-like">8. Dómine, Déus virtútum, exáudi oratiónem méam:“auribus pér¬</l><l xml:id="m-017f43f9-5d60-4de7-ba0a-ddf8411cf271" facs="#m-e48d27ba-eba3-44b6-a9e5-2e1cd7dd1570" label="lyrics-like">cipe, Déus Jácob.</l><l xml:id="m-3f77625f-6076-4b62-a7fb-a919007b682f" facs="#m-742ea397-a0fb-4ca7-a84d-0ce98961b693" label="lyrics-like">9. Protéctor nóster, áspice, Déus:“et réspice in fáciem Christi túi.</l><l xml:id="m-0d3765eb-4313-44fd-ad33-70bfe885dad1" facs="#m-3ef064ad-6c50-42b6-842a-1ad24d32faae" label="lyrics-like">10. Quia mélior est dies úna in átriis túis, * millia.</l><l xml:id="m-253264bc-c700-4fde-b650-4f575eb7b144" facs="#m-2a61995d-dad4-4a8d-98ff-a35f633657ee" label="lyrics-like">11. Élégi abjéctus ésse in dómo Dét méi, “magis quam habitáre in</l><l xml:id="m-c7887da9-405e-4bdf-a2e0-aae18f429def" facs="#m-35090384-a947-4f23-ba05-62e923430ec9" label="lyrics-like">tabernáculis peccatórum.</l><l xml:id="m-668717af-07e0-447e-a633-d92a9271a696" facs="#m-438b350d-4bd5-4698-836c-7d6389cff8b6" label="lyrics-like">12. Quia misericórdiam et veritátem diligit Déus: * grátiam et gló¬</l><l xml:id="m-d4ab6d61-98e7-413a-a6e4-e940955d13ce" facs="#m-52fd5467-6eae-45a7-814c-0778abe4f994" label="lyrics-like">riam dábit Dóminus.</l><l xml:id="m-97390f03-5c78-4f5f-8dbb-a0986a85c601" facs="#m-8821fe7b-ecec-4a18-b826-02a08ea63ab1" label="lyrics-like">13. Non privábit bónis éos, qui ámbulant in innocéntia: “Dómine</l><l xml:id="m-30d81955-df74-448f-97e4-d4185be37fa1" facs="#m-7ef7354f-8ebe-4763-b6e8-e90ea88a05df" label="lyrics-like">virtútum, beátus hómo qui spérat in te.</l><l xml:id="m-24923c0f-9d70-4456-96ee-a0d7fa4d30fe" facs="#m-401a1b46-460b-45be-bd11-860838bfb3cb" label="lyrics-like">14. Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiritui Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-063cbe77-7700-409a-8427-2e7dabc05e84" facs="#m-b773fb92-08a1-47ff-980c-2ebcfe286b37" label="lyrics-like">15. Sicut érat in princípio, et nunc, et sémper, * et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-5eb54484-b66e-410d-86d4-35d7cb5b7361" facs="#m-f69e2c33-a7c4-4d91-8588-fc7ad4d9a12a" label="lyrics-like">tórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-ed91cb1d-5117-4914-8931-60222d1b8217" facs="#m-a4a21b3f-02e6-4d58-8fa4-e8083897e0e0" label="lyrics-like">v. Edúcas pánem de térra, alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-f5b992ce-3e94-4534-b271-bef95924dd50" facs="#m-9fae3934-b925-4035-9ef9-398f3c71bb1a" label="lyrics-like">N. Et vínum laetíficet cor hóminis, alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-4138dad1-6f1d-42b5-9872-2e997de31154" facs="#m-6e2b246e-4605-4a15-9808-3f292f701614" label="ambiguous">Pater noster.</l><l xml:id="m-141b39fd-46c5-4787-94f5-f3507475b82d" facs="#m-d6165b86-5c88-4345-b7dc-6e74eeca6336" label="lyrics-like">Absolution : A vínculis peccatórum nostrórum“absólvat nos omni¬</l><l xml:id="m-82ebfc25-9f64-4443-8a76-504f142fee3d" facs="#m-5e5b64cd-0e1c-423a-96b4-f4b7aeacdaa6" label="lyrics-like">potens et miséricors Dóminus. E. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-3d5dd977-0df5-41f7-b82d-800d9541561e" facs="#m-ff5befb9-d4bf-4f24-9257-c8e6051e4594" label="lyrics-like">The Lector : Jube, domne, benedícere.</l><l xml:id="m-886b71c4-c3bd-430c-ac96-0cfb3a4a5658" facs="#m-7f0ced9a-1e47-43b0-80c2-58d358564c64" label="lyrics-like">Blessing: Evangélica léctio* sit nobis salus et protéctio. R. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-2673fa2f-844e-446e-a5e9-c2ae1e060519" facs="#m-3f83ba47-1ef7-45a3-b30c-a4ba65947d68" label="lyrics-like">Léctio sancti Evangélii secúndum Joánnem.</l><l xml:id="m-73b33136-c641-4254-aaeb-4f4c62418df5" facs="#m-04cce5f1-52e8-49e6-8970-748b5c21417a" label="ambiguous">Cap. 6.f.</l><l xml:id="m-e74727b1-64cc-4891-a0e0-c199cf9be52f" facs="#m-9b9a375c-e572-41fe-bfa5-2f26e2aa750e" label="ambiguous">Lesson VII.</l><l xml:id="m-db67dc8f-a56b-423d-9814-cd8bbd87adb1" facs="#m-8a8d201a-52d1-4ecb-b5fc-1b7578d4defd" label="lyrics-like">Nillo témpore: Dixit Jesus vere est cibus, et sanguis meus vere</l><l xml:id="m-730c20e7-52ba-4210-aad6-fcb7a6bc4f67" facs="#m-9a29efb6-00ca-450e-99c4-e0343c886e05" label="lyrics-like">I turbis Judaeórum: Caro mea! est potus. Et réliqua.</l><l xml:id="m-a416a22a-c113-4e3a-ac33-0ea67398edeb" facs="#m-7fd4a868-d7dd-46bf-bf41-7ec461969475" label="lyrics-like">Homilía sancti Augustini Epíscopi.</l><l xml:id="m-0b61c924-0269-4826-bf6e-a71e02611aa9" facs="#m-831fdd4e-ec01-429e-9263-a3c7b7c186ff" label="lyrics-like">NVUM cibo et potu id áppetant! Dóminus noster Jesus Christus cor¬</l><l xml:id="m-72f51082-55e5-449d-a75e-ee663321d858" facs="#m-25930f5b-e09a-4769-92b2-57807ec22ab8" label="lyrics-like">L hómines, ut neque esúriant, pus et sánguinem suum in eis rebus</l><l xml:id="m-4f04615d-0bb6-498f-a701-0429f0cda48c" facs="#m-63219930-cdcd-4139-b688-a9566701f4ae" label="lyrics-like">neque sitiant: hoc veráciter non commendávit, quae ad unum áli¬</l><l xml:id="m-3e5b7aba-341e-48f2-b3b1-e003ea9ae311" facs="#m-c5275724-a40e-4f86-8487-eece0c836411" label="lyrics-like">praestat, nisi iste cibus et potus, qui quid redigúntur ex multis. Namque</l><l xml:id="m-670db6ee-6994-41b0-bff0-6b2caa090a15" facs="#m-9cca4e20-c0cf-4cf8-9b7e-4f301610eed6" label="lyrics-like">áliud in unum ex multis granis</l><l xml:id="m-71142166-9154-4d88-a7f1-26841bfb327f" facs="#m-57391748-77c3-4f45-96e9-1cc26a9e0f03" label="lyrics-like">eos, a quibus súmitur, immortáles</l><l xml:id="m-c9b0f3c8-fc2d-4e9e-8ea4-62515900a80c" facs="#m-7626c5cc-d085-4a5d-8a28-cc9804a8eaac" label="lyrics-like">et incorruptibiles facit; id est, so¬ conficitur : áliud in unum ex multis</l><l xml:id="m-41f11dc5-3b4d-4b9a-b7d6-e97a79570571" facs="#m-c345cf71-7768-4c93-a97f-bc7a722efe3a" label="lyrics-like">ácinis cónfluit. Dénique iam expó¬</l><l xml:id="m-e80f372c-4fe4-47a8-8eff-8575120f54ed" facs="#m-adf270cc-5c9b-4ab5-a81d-e2b10d238575" label="lyrics-like">cietas ipsa Sanctórum, ubi pax erit,</l><l xml:id="m-3d9deb2f-1d3c-495c-8af7-329bc49b0b6f" facs="#m-3425a1c1-f795-4861-86aa-4b337cfc29b6" label="lyrics-like">nit quómodo id fiat, quod lóquitur:</l><l xml:id="m-8baa3c4a-8a3e-4d19-a7cf-4eb2ad230330" facs="#m-f21f7f07-12a8-428f-8e9e-bfee1a682850" label="lyrics-like">et únitas plena atque perfécta.</l><l xml:id="m-4f926656-3645-4e36-b908-6b3a4625b6b2" facs="#m-0ccd982f-931e-4760-ae02-93ed939e0769" label="lyrics-like">Proptérea quippe, sicut étiam ante! et quid sit manducáre corpus ejus,</l><l xml:id="m-da832e83-1626-44de-ad43-ce9ee9c352ce" facs="#m-0eaf4666-3f00-4286-b0d5-8cb3b646c077" label="lyrics-like">nos hoc intellexérunt hómines Dei.] et sánguinem bibere.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>